  m_text: '- Collect corn kernels to score points

    - Avoid silos, wind turbines,
    and balloons

    - In Hard mode, watch out for tornados that shoot mini ones

    -
    Pick up a helmet for one free hit



    - On offense: Collect footballs and
    drop or carry them into the field goal to score and avoid Cyclone birds flying
    your way

    - Press E to drop footballs

    - On defense: Aim to hit the opposing
    birds

    - Pick up a helmet for one free hit

'
